category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Implementations of a fast Elliptic-curve Diffie-Hellman primitive (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "curve25519 is an elliptic curve, developed by Dan Bernstein, for fast
Diffie-Hellman key agreement. DJB's original implementation was written in a
language of his own devising called qhasm. The original qhasm source isn't
available, only the x86 32-bit assembly output."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/agl/curve25519-donna
license: BSD-3-Clause
